-- Kling effects (fal-ai/kling-video/v1.6/pro/effects, 75 after the safety list),
-- with Kling's own demo clip and cover from its public Effects Center docs
-- (kling.ai/document-api/…/effectsCenter), linked from Kling's CDN. The CDN
-- names files after the effect_scene, so sync-effects finds demos for new ones too.
-- Price: $0.098/s × 5 s = $0.49 → 62 credits. Mixed into the Vidu feed by category
-- (same backdated created_at, sort interleaved), not stacked on top.
-- Left out: alcohol (drunk dance, toasts), fight, Nezha (film character), girlfriend,
-- and the two-person *_pro effects, which need a second photo on Kling.

